---
// Hero backdrop "Glow": a soft light rises from under the text, in the accent and two
// of the identity tints, and drifts slowly. The page's grid shows only where the light
// falls. Every few seconds a thin ring spreads out from the centre and fades, like a
// message reaching everyone in the room.
//
// CSS only: gradients and transforms, no filters, so it stays cheap. Under reduced
// motion it holds still.
---
<div class="hero-bg hero-glow" data-variant="3" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="glow-grid"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb o1"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb o2"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb o3"></div>
  <div class="glow-ring r1"></div>
  <div class="glow-ring r2"></div>
  <div class="glow-ring r3"></div>
</div>
